COMPND   9 OTHER_DETAILS: NATIVE GLUA2 IS A MEMBRANE PROTEIN. THE CRYSTALLIZED  
COMPND  10 PROTEIN IS A L540Y-N775S-MUTANT OF THE GLUA2 LIGAND-BINDING DOMAIN.  
